ergic to animals so she  can't  but as time goes on the dog seems like  it no longer recognizes her and starts  like growling when she approaches uh by  the way nothing bad happens to the dog  so don't worry um you know i'm an animal  lover too and every time a dog or a cat  like appears in a horror story my little  my stomach always clenches i'm like oh  no this poor little baby this poor  little baby something bad's gonna happen  but nothing bad happens to the dog okay  so i'm just telling you right there i  understand that's you know so i just  thought i had to tell you tell you that  and there are also a bunch of other  little things like she takes up smoking  again uh in spite of her husband's  protest oh my god you quit such a long  time ago and it's bad for your health  blah blah  she starts shoplifting and not really  realizing that she did so um you know  she has kind of little brief like  blackouts where she's like oh you know  like one time she's at work and she goes  out to lunch and then she has like an  hour that she can't account for which  she doesn't know what she was doing  um she gets more easily irritated with  her husband like picking petty fights  with him and also starts snapping at  strangers for just like minor slights  she gets the feeling uh overall that her  personality  is changing like in small and subtle  ways  and when she happens upon friends that  haven't seen her in a long time  they always tell her she looks different  like maybe  you're you've gained a little weight but  you look good like you look healthy you  look happy but they can't ever put their  finger quite on what it is that's  different about her like maybe your skin  looks nicer maybe you're pregnant maybe  you know what i mean it's always kind of  like did you get your hair done or did  you get some work done or something like  that they always say like she looks  better but they can't like put her put  their finger on what it is that's  different and then there are a